#. Description of pointonium
#. The "%s" is replaced by the ◬ character. In english the text becomes:
#. "... as shown by the ◬ indicator."
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:78
msgid "Enemies release Pointonium when destroyed. The amount spawned scales with your kill rate, as shown by the %s indicator. Gathering Pointonium increases your score."
msgstr "Los enemigos dejan Puntonium cuando los destruyes, la cantidad que aparece incrementa con tu tasa de destruidos, como se muestra en el indicador %s. El obtener Puntonium aumenta tu puntuación."

#. Description of the "Asteroid" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:91
msgid "A bumpy, white asteroid that floats in space. Shoot it and it splits into multiple smaller parts. Exists in 4 different sizes."
msgstr "Un asteroide blanco y rugoso que flota en el espacio. Al dispararlo, se divide en múltiples partes más pequeñas. Existen 4 tamaños."

#. Description of the "BAF" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:102
msgid "This yellow, arrow-shaped drone zips predictably back and forth."
msgstr "Este dron amarillo con forma de flecha se mueve de forma predecible de un lado para otro."

#. Description of the "Red BAF" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:110
msgid "This red arrow-shaped drone mirrors the familiar movements of the standard BAF, but it is much stronger posing a greater threat."
msgstr "Este dron rojo con forma de flecha imita los movimientos habituales del BAF estándar, pero es más resistente y supone una amenaza mayor."

#. Description of the "Blue BAF" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:118
msgid "Unlike its yellow and red counterparts, it bounces off walls in unpredictable directions, making its movement difficult to anticipate."
msgstr "A diferencia de sus contrapartes amarillas y rojas, este rebota contra las paredes de forma impredecible, haciendo que su movimiento sea difícil de predecir."

#. Description of the "Brownian" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:145
msgid "A tetrahedron-shaped enemy that advances on your position with erratic, unpredictable movements."
msgstr "Un enemigo con forma de tetraedro que avanza hacia tu dirección con movimientos erráticos e impredecibles."

#. Description of the "Crowders" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:161
msgid "An octahedron-shaped enemy that slowly advances on you. Tends to form dense crowds with other Crowders."
msgstr "Un enemigo con forma de octaedro que avanza lentamente hacia ti. Tiende a formar densas multitudes con otros Crowders."

#. Description of the "Dodger" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:169
msgid "An hourglass-shaped enemy that advances towards the nearest ship while actively evading projectiles. Like Crowders, has a tendency to form crowds."
msgstr "Un enemigo con forma de reloj de arena que avanza hacia la nave más cercana mientras esquiva proyectiles. Como los Crowders, tiende a formar multitudes."

#. Description of the "Exploder" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:177
msgid "An inscribed polygram that advances towards the nearest ship. Upon its destruction, releases a blast of energy that damages any ship it touches."
msgstr "Un poligrama inscrito que avanza hacia la nave más cercana. Al destruirse, libera una explosión de energía que daña a toda nave que toque."

#. Description of the "Inertiac" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:189
msgid "Made of rotating concentric circles, it plunges towards the nearest ship with inertia. Very resistant to damage, it can fortunately be repelled with bullets."
msgstr "Compuesto por círculos concéntricos giratorios, se precipita hacia la nave más cercana con inercia. Muy resistente al daño, pero puede ser repelido con balas."

#. Description of the "Kamikaze" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:198
msgid "A flying ship that relentlessly scans for a prey. Once it locks onto you, it immediately charges forward, attempting to ram you head-on"
msgstr "Una nave voladora que constantemente busca una presa. Cuando te tiene en el punto de mira, se lanza hacia delante, intentando embestirte de frente."

#. Description of the "Pink Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:207
msgid "A pink triangle-shaped mothership that roams the levels. Upon its destruction it unleashes three arcs of bullets from its sides."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza rosa con forma de triángulo que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, dispara tres arcos de balas desde sus lados."

#. Description of the "Red Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:217
msgid "A red square-shaped mothership that roams the levels. Upon its destruction it unleashes a barrage of homing bullets that pursue the nearest ship."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza roja con forma de cuadrado que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, lanza un montón de balas teledirigidas que persiguen la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the "Orange Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:227
msgid "An orange, pentagon-shaped mothership that roams the levels. Upon its destruction it fires six bullets in a hexagon pattern."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza naranja con forma de pentágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, dispara seis balas en forma de hexágono."

#. Description of the "Green Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:237
msgid "A green, hexagon-shaped mothership that roams the levels. Upon its destruction it unleashes a circle of bullets."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza verde con forma de hexágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, lanza un círculo de balas."

#. Description of the "Cyan Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:247
msgid "A cyan, heptagon-shaped mothership that roams the levels. Upon its destruction, it fires a dense arc of bullets towards the nearest ship."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza cian con forma de heptágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, dispara un arco denso de balas hacia la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the "Super Pink Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:257
msgid "An extra-large, pink, triangle-shaped mothership. Upon its destruction, unleashes three arcs of large bullets from its sides."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza enorme, rosa, y con forma de triángulo. Al destruirla, dispara tres arcos de balas grandes desde sus lados."

#. Description of the "Super Red Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:267
msgid "An extra-large, red, squared-shaped mothership. Upon its destruction, unleashes large homing bullets that actively pursue the nearest ship."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza enorme, roja, y con forma de cuadrado que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, lanza un montón de balas grandes y teledirigidas que persiguen la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the "Super Orange Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:277
msgid "An extra-large orange, pentagon-shaped mothership. Upon its destruction it fires four times the number of bullets compared to its standard counterpart."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza enorme, naranja, y con forma de pentágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, dispara cuatro veces más balas que su contraparte estándar."

#. Description of the "Super Green Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:287
msgid "An extra-large green, hexagon-shaped mothership. Upon its destruction, fires an extremely dense circle of large and fast bullets."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza enorme, verde, y con forma de hexágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, lanza un círculo de balas extremadamente denso."

#. Description of the "Super Cyan Mothership" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:297
msgid "An extra-large cyan, heptagon-shaped mothership. Upon its destruction, fires a huge arc of large and fast bullets towards the nearest ship."
msgstr "Una nave nodriza enorme, cian, y con forma de heptágono que recorre los niveles. Al destruirla, dispara un arco de balas grande y rápido hacia la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the "Rolling Cube" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:307
msgid "A cube-shaped enemy that rolls through the levels. It constantly seeks out the nearest ship, and its speed increases progressively over time."
msgstr "Un enemigo con forma de cubo que rueda por los niveles. Busca constantemente la nave más cercana, e incrementa su velocidad progresivamente con el tiempo."

#. Description of the "Rolling Sphere" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:317
msgid "A spherical enemy that rolls around the levels, bouncing off walls. While immune to standard bullets, it will shrink when hit by a Freeze bomb."
msgstr "Un enemigo esférico que rueda por los niveles, rebotando en las paredes. Aunque inmune a las balas, reduce su tamaño cuando dañado por una bomba congelante."

#. Description of the "Spiny" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:345
msgid "An arrow-shaped enemy that moves along circular paths, bouncing of walls. Possesses a tendency to drift towards nearby ships."
msgstr "Un enemigo con forma de flecha que se mueve en patrones circulares, rebotando en las paredes. Tiende a desplazarse hacia la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the "Splitter" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:353
msgid "A pink, flower-shaped enemy that drifts in random directions. Upon its destruction, it unleashes petals that scatter in a circular pattern."
msgstr "Un enemigo rosa con forma de flor que se desplaza en direcciones aleatorias. Al ser destruido, desprende pétalos que se mueven en patrones circulares."

#. Description of the "UFO" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:361
msgid "A red, flying saucer shaped enemy that glides across the levels. Regularly shoot bullets towards the nearest ship that also happen to damage other enemies."
msgstr "Un enemigo rojo con forma de platillo volante se desliza por los niveles. Dispara balas regularmente hacia la nave más cercana, las cuales pueden dañar otros enemigos."

#. Description of the "Wary" enemy
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:371
msgid "A small blue-purple hexagon-shaped enemy that wanders aimlessly through the levels. Fires homing bullets towards the nearest ship."
msgstr "Un enemigo pequeño de color azul purpúreo y con forma de hexágono que deambula sin rumbo por los niveles. Dispara balas teledirigidas hacia la nave más cercana."

#. Description of the Shield bonus
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:379
msgid "Grants additional shield points."
msgstr "Proporciona puntos de escudo adicionales."

#. Description of the Weapon bonus
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:389
msgid "Grants a weapon upgrade upon pickup. Usually temporary."
msgstr "Proporciona una mejora de arma al tomar. De uso temporal."

#. Description of the Speed bonus
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:412
msgid "Grants a speed boost upon pickup. Usually temporary."
msgstr "Proporciona un impulso de velocidad al tomar. De uso temporal."

#. Description of the Mace bonus
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:422
msgid "Grants a Mace upon pickup. Usually temporary."
msgstr "Proporciona una Maza al tomar. De uso temporal. "

#. Description of the Entanglement Pad
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:432
msgid "Appears in groups in multiplayer. Occupy all pads to trigger a bonus."
msgstr "Aparece en grupos en multijugador.  Ocupa todos los pads para activar un bonus."

#. Used in the Encyclopedia to show the health of a destroyable entity.
#. The %s is replaced by a number or a set of numbers
#. For example:
#. Health: 1
#. Health: 1, 2, 3
#: /client/application/pewpewlive/ui/screens/screen_encyclopedia.cpp:488
msgid "Health: %s"
msgstr "Salud: %s"

